==================================================
/                       Landing (CTA above the fold)
/discover               Search + filters + results (filters synced to URL query params)
/scholarships/:id       Detail page
/dashboard              Personal overview
/tracker                Application board (Saved, Preparing, Submitted, Decision)
/calendar               Deadlines timeline
/compare?ids=a,b,c      Side-by-side comparison, max 3
/profile                Multi-step profile (also first-run onboarding) + settings (theme, data export/import, reset)
