All routes lazy-loaded with a Suspense fallback skeleton. Wrap the app in an ErrorBoundary with a friendly recovery screen.

Global shell: skip-to-content link; header with logo, primary nav, theme toggle, profile menu; mobile bottom navigation (Discover, Tracker, Calendar, Profile) with 44px+ targets; footer with legal links, "Cookie settings" link, contact address, and a visible "Sample data" notice. On route change, move focus to the page h1 and announce the page title for screen readers.

